<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan grains/oilseeds tender results - October.</title>
<headline>Taiwan grains/oilseeds tender results - October.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan interests bought during October a total of 327,000 tonnes U.S. soybeans, 244,000 tonnes of U.S. corn and 33,000 tonnes U.S. barley at tenders.</p>
<p>Basic information of October soybean/corn tender results</p>
<p>(Prices based on US$ per tonne)</p>
<p> Oct Buyer     Tonne  Type  Delivery     Seller  Price/Freight</p>
